# Valgrind suppressions for the hardened native CLI run.
#
# mimalloc's process initialisation probes /sys for transparent-huge-page
# support and scans the read buffer with its own strnlen; valgrind cannot see
# the kernel's write into that buffer and reports an uninitialised read. The
# probe is inside mimalloc itself, runs once before main, and touches no
# Nivren data. Remove when upstream mimalloc initialises the probe buffer
# (mimalloc issue tracker: unix_detect_thp).
{
   mimalloc-thp-detection-probe
   Memcheck:Cond
   ...
   fun:unix_detect_thp
}
